{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33089","headline":"和顾非熊先生题茅山处士闲居 · 储嗣宗","name":"和顾非熊先生题茅山处士闲居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"归耕地肺绝尘喧，匣里青萍未报恩。\n浊酒自怜终日醉，古风时得野人言。\n鸟啼碧树闲临水，花满青山静掩门。\n唯有阶前芳草色，年年惆怅忆王孙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储嗣宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33089.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33089","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}